00:28:55.509 --> 00:28:58.509
to release moisture, deliver the virus, and knockout blow.

00:28:58.509 --> 00:29:01.509
We should be able to create a curative precipitation to blanket the city.

00:29:01.509 --> 00:29:03.509
We've reached our target coordinates.

00:29:03.509 --> 00:29:05.509
We're prepared to launch.

00:29:05.509 --> 00:29:28.869
When the event something goes wrong, I want you to know your contributions have been appreciated.

00:29:28.869 --> 00:29:34.140
Nothing's going wrong.

00:29:34.140 --> 00:29:37.140
Now I know why I've ever had such faith in you.

00:29:37.140 --> 00:29:40.140
I finally met someone who was a match for his confidence.

00:29:40.140 --> 00:29:44.650
Probably no surprise that you were the one to betray him.

00:29:44.650 --> 00:29:47.650
Are you going to explain that not so subtle barb?

00:29:47.650 --> 00:29:50.650
Well, you've been tracking Oliver in the rest of his league, haven't you?

00:29:50.650 --> 00:29:57.619
Apparently, you've made yourself more at home at Watchtower than I thought.

00:29:57.619 --> 00:30:01.960
May I ask why you're spying on him?

00:30:01.960 --> 00:30:05.960
The longer they stay separated, the more vulnerable they are.

00:30:05.960 --> 00:30:06.960
So you're protecting them?

00:30:06.960 --> 00:30:08.960
Yes. Someone has to.

00:30:08.960 --> 00:30:12.960
I'm not sure if you've noticed, but the people who are the worst at taking care of themselves

00:30:12.960 --> 00:30:13.960
are the ones.

00:30:13.960 --> 00:30:15.960
the world actually needs the most.

00:30:15.960 --> 00:30:18.960
I assume that no one else knows this.

00:30:18.960 --> 00:30:23.680
What's my secret?

00:30:23.680 --> 00:30:27.380
Now the real question is, will you keep it?

00:30:27.380 --> 00:30:31.869
Well, I guess you'll just have to trust me.

00:30:31.869 --> 00:30:44.779
Lois.

00:30:44.779 --> 00:30:59.799
Lois, are you okay?

00:30:59.799 --> 00:31:00.799
Lois!

00:31:00.799 --> 00:33:29.230
Keep her awake.

00:33:29.230 --> 00:33:31.230
But Lois almost died.

00:33:31.230 --> 00:33:37.299
You spiraled down so far you couldn't even protect her.

00:33:37.299 --> 00:33:40.299
Is there any part of the person I used to know still there?

00:33:40.299 --> 00:33:52.099
Maybe not.

00:33:52.099 --> 00:33:54.099
I understand that it's hard trying to figure out

00:33:54.099 --> 00:33:55.099
how to come.

00:33:55.099 --> 00:33:56.099
Come back from what happened.

00:33:56.099 --> 00:34:00.400
Maybe you need help.

00:34:00.400 --> 00:34:03.400
Actually, I thought about what you said.

00:34:03.400 --> 00:34:12.420
And, uh, I took a look in the mirror and you were right.

00:34:12.420 --> 00:34:21.530
I've been running away from myself for a long time now.

00:34:21.530 --> 00:34:25.739
Now I know who I really am.

00:34:25.739 --> 00:34:26.739
Then you know what you have to do.

00:34:26.739 --> 00:36:20.320
Thank you, Clark.

00:36:20.320 --> 00:36:22.320
Came by to say thanks.

00:36:22.320 --> 00:36:25.320
And to apologize if I tried to rip your head off or anything.

00:36:25.320 --> 00:36:31.739
What do mean left hook?

00:36:31.739 --> 00:36:32.739
I don't remember any of that.

00:36:32.739 --> 00:36:38.809
But I do remember seeing a whole new side of Clark kit.

00:36:38.809 --> 00:36:41.380
Which side was that?

00:36:41.380 --> 00:36:43.380
I'll give you a hint.

00:36:43.380 --> 00:36:46.719
Starts with H and ends with Eero.

00:36:46.719 --> 00:36:50.219
I wasn't even wearing red or blue.

00:36:50.219 --> 00:36:54.570
Well, you've got a long ways to go before you can do that.

00:36:54.570 --> 00:36:59.039
Still, I think we make a pretty good team.

00:36:59.039 --> 00:37:01.039
Yeah, we do.

00:37:01.039 --> 00:37:09.980
You never did tell me your secret.

00:37:09.980 --> 00:37:10.980
Relax, Smallville.

00:37:10.980 --> 00:37:21.460
Keep the mystery.

00:37:21.460 --> 00:37:25.460
You need to work every last drop of it you've got.

00:37:25.460 --> 00:38:30.690
Three things cannot be long hidden.

00:38:30.690 --> 00:38:48.480
A sacred human text from a prophet they call Buddha.

00:38:48.480 --> 00:38:58.699
Major Zahn.

00:38:58.699 --> 00:39:04.820
And the truth is, you become reckless, haven't you?

00:39:04.820 --> 00:39:08.820
Unleashing a hostile virus to humanity.

00:39:08.820 --> 00:39:20.139
Have you lost your foresight?

00:39:20.139 --> 00:39:23.139
I did it all for our survival.

00:39:23.139 --> 00:39:28.139
Our clock of anonymity is the only thing keeping our presence from this world.

00:39:28.139 --> 00:39:35.920
They will hunt us when they discovered the virus's true origin.

00:39:35.920 --> 00:39:43.050
They won't have the chance, sir.

00:39:43.050 --> 00:39:44.050
I found the secret to our...

00:39:44.050 --> 00:39:46.050
abilities that were promised us.

00:39:46.050 --> 00:39:47.050
While you were rounding up our people,

00:39:47.050 --> 00:39:50.050
I discovered one of us right here in Metropolis,

00:39:50.050 --> 00:40:16.909
under our noses.

00:40:16.909 --> 00:40:17.909
He survived.

00:40:17.909 --> 00:40:19.909
Major.

00:40:19.909 --> 00:40:22.909
He didn't just survive, according to the news reports

00:40:22.909 --> 00:40:24.909
of miraculous cities around the city.

00:40:24.909 --> 00:40:27.909
He has the power from the yellow sun.

00:40:27.909 --> 00:40:29.909
And yet we have none?

00:40:29.909 --> 00:40:33.909
He has chosen to harness the powers for himself

00:40:33.909 --> 00:40:37.670
and left us defenseless.

00:40:37.670 --> 00:40:39.670
Durell betrayed us.

00:40:39.670 --> 00:40:40.670
Releasing the virus with the virus.

00:40:40.670 --> 00:40:42.670
the most effective way to uncover him.

00:40:42.670 --> 00:40:53.309
Were you successful?

00:40:53.309 --> 00:40:56.309
His blood was used to create the antidote to the virus.

00:40:56.309 --> 00:40:57.309
Track it?

00:40:57.309 --> 00:41:06.099
He's ours.

00:41:06.099 --> 00:41:08.099
I trust you see the risk was worth it.

00:41:08.099 --> 00:41:13.099
It takes a certain kind of man to step outside the boundaries of his station.

